{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hqFoFGCOmH_F3BWKsoBrmw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:06.878270+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hqFoFGCOmH_F3BWKsoBrmw","html":"<div><section><section><span><span><span><span>南开大学是国家“985工程”和“211工程”重点</span></span></span><span><span><span>建设的教育部</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>直属高校。2017年9月，入选国家42所世界一流大学建设高校，且</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>为36所</span></span></span><span><span><span>A</span></span></span><span><span><span>类高校之一。南开大学地处渤海之滨，白河之津。在百余</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年的办学历程中，南开大学形成了文理并重、基础宽厚、突出应用与</span></span></span><span><span><span>创新的办学特色，综合实力位居国内高校前列，培育出了许多杰出的</span></span></span><span><span><span>校友，周恩来、曹禺、陈省身、吴大猷便是其中的佼佼者。</span></span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span><span>南开大学数学学科于1920年创建，是我国第二个</span></span></span><span><span><span>数学系，专业</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>门类齐全、综合实力雄厚，是国内外有重要影响的人才培养和自主研</span></span></span><span><span><span>究基地。几十年来为我国近代数学的发展培养了一批卓越的人才，著</span></span></span><span><span><span>名数学家陈省身先生、著名数学家与教育家江泽涵先生、吴大任先生</span></span></span><span><span><span>就是其中的代表人物。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>为促进国内各高校有志于数学研究的优秀大学生</span></span></span><span><span><span>的交流互动，帮助</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学生洞悉数学学科前沿动态，拓展研究视野，深入了解南开数学，</span><span>南开</span></span></span><span><span><span>大学数学科学学院(以下简称数学学院)、陈省身数学研究所(以下简</span></span></span><span><span><span>称数学所)与组合数学中心(以下简称组合中心)拟联合举办“2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生交流营”</span><span>。</span></span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>欢迎优秀的青年学子们报名参加！</span></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>交流营相关安排</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>一、交流营简介</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>数学学院、数学所及组合中心拟于2026年6月1</span></span></span><span><span><span>7日-18日举办全</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>国优秀大学生交流营</span><span>。交流营活动涉及数学学科情况介绍、专业方向介绍、数学国际交流项目介绍(南开-斯坦福、南开-牛津项目等)、导师</span></span></span><span><span><span>面对面等内容。</span></span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>二、基本要求：</span></span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>热爱祖国，遵纪守法，诚实守信，品德优良，身心健康；</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span><span><span><span>本科三年级在读生(2027年应届毕业生),成绩优异，达到</span></span></span><span><span><span>所在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>高校推荐免试生要求，能获得所在高校的推免生资格，专业不限；</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>热忱于科学事业，具有较好的科研潜力；</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>三、英语符合以下任一项：</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(1)通过全国大学英语六级考试(六级成绩425分及以上)或通过全</span></span></span><span><span><span>国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀(四级成绩550分及以上);</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>(2) </span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>成绩90分及以上；</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(3)</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>IELTS</span></span></span><span><span><span>(A</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>类/学术类)成绩6分及以上；</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>(4) </span></span></span><span><span><span>GRE </span></span></span><span><span><span>成绩在310以上， </span></span></span><span><span><span>GMAT</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩在64</span></span></span><span><span><span>0以上；</span></span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(5)英语专业四级(及以上)考试合格。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>四、申请方式</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>1.通过问卷星：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/tEMT5vB.aspx</span></span><span><span>#</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>填写个人</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>基本信息并上传如下材料(注：所有材料按以下排列顺序制成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>文档。</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>名称： “本科学校全称+报名专业+学生姓名+申请类型”):</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(1)本科成绩单和专业排名证明(需加盖学校教务部门公章);</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(2)符合要求的英语考试成绩单复印件</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>(3)其他证明材料，包括：获奖证书复印件；本人代表性学术论</span></span></span><span><span><span>文、出版物或原创性成果等。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>2.</span><span>报名截止时间6月11日18:00</span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span><span><span><span>数学学科专业包括以下：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>(专业不限报)</span></span></span><span><span><span>基础数学、计算数学、概率论与数理统计、应用数学、应用数学(中-澳双学位)、生物信息学、数理经济、理论物理。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>数学学院、数学所、组合中心将成立选拔小组对考生报名申请材</span></span></span><span><span><span>料进行审核、择优选拔优秀学生参加交流营。我们将于6月13日前完</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成资格审核并通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>Email</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>通知入选申请者。请及时查看审核结果，并按</span></span></span><span><span><span>要求及时回复，未在规定时间内回复的，视为自动放弃参营资格。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span><span><span><span>学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作</span></span></span><span><span><span>假，一经查</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>实，取消其参营或录取资格。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>营员需全程参加活动，如确有特殊情况，请提出书面申请。擅自</span></span></span><span><span><span>离营视为自动放弃资格，不予提供相关资助。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>六、营员待遇</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>交流营活动期间为全体营员提供免费食宿(天津</span></span></span><span><span><span>市内高校营员不提</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>供住宿)。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>1.数学科学学院</span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>电话：022-23501233</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>联系人：刘老师，殷老师</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>Email:   </span></span></span><span><span><span>mathyjs@nanka</span></span></span><span><span><span>i.edu.cn</span></span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>地址：天津市南开区卫津路94号，南开大学数学科学学院</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>邮编：300071</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>数学科学学院主页：</span></span><span><span>https://math.nankai.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>2.陈省身数学研究所：</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>电话：022-23501879</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>联系人：冯老师</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>Email:</span></span></span><span><span><span>gracefeng@nankai.edu.cn</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>地址：天津市南开区卫津路94号，南开大学陈省身数学研究所</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>邮编：300071</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>陈省身数学研究所主页：</span></span><span><span>http://www.cim.nankai.edu.cn/</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span>3.组合数学中心：</span></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>电话：022-23502180</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>联系人：吴老师</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>Email:</span></span></span><span><span><span>wuyan@nankai.edu.cn</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>地址：天津市南开区卫津路94号，南开大学组合数学中心</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>邮编：300071</span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span><span>组合数学中心主页：</span></span></span><span><span><span>http://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>南开大学数学科学学院</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><sect